# Code owners for the infrastructure repository.
#
# A CODEOWNERS entry adds the named reviewer automatically and, combined with
# "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection, makes that review
# mandatory. It exists here because a workflow change is the one change that
# can be merged, look fine, and break every other repository's pipeline.
#
# Replace the placeholders with real GitHub handles before enabling the
# branch-protection rule — an unresolvable owner blocks every PR.

# Everything, by default.
*                           @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers

# Deployment and release paths get an extra pair of eyes: these are the files
# where a mistake reaches production rather than CI.
/.github/workflows/deploy-production.yml   @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers
/.github/workflows/release.yml             @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers
/.github/workflows/publish-marketplace.yml @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers
/compose/docker-compose.prod.yml           @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers
/action.yml                                @TeamNova-SRI-KO-LMS/maintainers
